{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DSS is a real-time grand strategy game with city-building and resource management.<br><br>Experience a groundbreaking game with limitless armies, endless cities, and unparalleled resource simulation. Built to redefine wargames and push the boundaries of scale and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/2720b10f8b1b79dc8f9cf9efd85bd0a5.poster.avif?t=1759639710\" width=618 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/2720b10f8b1b79dc8f9cf9efd85bd0a5.webm?t=1759639710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/2720b10f8b1b79dc8f9cf9efd85bd0a5.mp4?t=1759639710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Building</strong>: Construct and develop your cities to support your war efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defenses</strong>: Turtle up with fortifications and guard posts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Establish production chains using logistics networks to ensure an efficient economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong>: Research science, unlock tech trees, and gain experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong>: Set up your medieval industry to keep running while you\u2019re off conquering new lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Army Tactics</strong>: Command your forces across the map while keeping them well-supplied and fed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Military Units</strong>: Create soldiers by combining items and specializations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy</strong>: Coerce others into joining your cause.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Game Modes</strong>: From intense boss battles to peaceful, creative building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Difficulty</strong>: Most systems run by themselves \u2014 you choose what to focus on or leave alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Scale</strong>: Hundreds of thousands of soldiers and workers are simulated in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creation Tools</strong>: Design maps, flags, characters, and voxel models.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Lab</strong>: Form armies and pit them against each other.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/ff9117ed65cdb9893a72955e1f6b3c35.poster.avif?t=1759639710\" width=618 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/ff9117ed65cdb9893a72955e1f6b3c35.webm?t=1759639710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/ff9117ed65cdb9893a72955e1f6b3c35.mp4?t=1759639710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582440?t=1759639710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/08ef5e917c3119def97578597adec8920341bcf1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759639710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/4497c05e23289de8a6b2f47c40786618a6d9657b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759639710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass